sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer
    participant EmailProcessing as Email Processing
    participant AIClassifier as AI Classification
    participant SmartRouter as Routing  
    participant Agent as WISMO Agent
    participant WooCommerce
    participant AfterShip
    participant AiAssistant as AI Assistant
    participant ApprovalQueue as Approval Queue
    participant ResponseSystem as Response System

    Note over Customer,ResponseSystem: Email Processing (WISMO)

    %% Step 1: Email Reception
    Customer->>EmailProcessing: Send Support Email
    EmailProcessing->>EmailProcessing: Receive via Gmail/Outlook<br/>(+ 15min polling backup)
    EmailProcessing->>EmailProcessing: Deduplicate (by Message/Thread ID)
    EmailProcessing->>AIClassifier: Process New Email

    %% Step 2: Smart Classification  
    AIClassifier->>AIClassifier: GPT-4o Classification<br/>(category + confidence score + priority)
    AIClassifier->>AIClassifier: Run Amazon Comprehend Sentiment Analysis
    AIClassifier->>AIClassifier: Retrieve Full Thread History
    AIClassifier->>SmartRouter: Classified Email (e.g., wismo)

    %% Step 3: Intelligent Routing
    SmartRouter->>WooCommerce: Lookup Customer & Order Data
    alt Confidence >= 60% and Category = WISMO
        SmartRouter->>Agent: Route to WISMO Agent
    else Confidence < 60% or Escalation Needed
        SmartRouter->>AiAssistant: Escalate to AI Assistant
    end

    %% Step 4: WISMO Agent Processing
    Agent->>Agent: AI Processing (Retrieve relevant data + generate AI response + response moderation)
    Agent->>Agent: Extract Order Number (GPT-4o AI)
    alt Order Number Not Found
        Agent->>WooCommerce: Search Recent Order by Email
        alt Order Found
            Agent->>AfterShip: Fetch Tracking Data
        else Order Not Found
            Agent->>AiAssistant: Escalate to AI Assistant
        end
    else Order Number Found
        Agent->>AfterShip: Fetch Tracking Data
    end

    %% Step 5: Tracking Data Processing
    alt Tracking Data Available
        Agent->>Agent: Generate Smart Response (based on tracking status)
        alt Auto-Send Enabled
            Agent->>ResponseSystem: Send Immediately
        else Needs Review
            Agent->>ApprovalQueue: Queue for Approval
            ApprovalQueue->>ResponseSystem: Approve & Proceed
        end
    else Tracking Data Unavailable or Error
        Agent->>AiAssistant: Escalate to AI Assistant
    end

    %% Step 6: Response Delivery
    ResponseSystem->>ResponseSystem: Validate & Send<br/>(Gmail/Outlook + SendGrid backup)
    ResponseSystem->>Customer: Deliver Response
    ResponseSystem->>ResponseSystem: Track Delivery & Update History

    %% Step 7: Error Handling
    Note over Customer,ResponseSystem: Log Metrics, Steps, & Save to Database Throughout
    alt Errors (Config, API Fail, Timeout, Outage)
        Customer->>AiAssistant: Escalate with Priority
    end
